        "### ACF and PACF — raw vs. differenced\n",
        "\n",
        "The autocorrelation function (ACF) measures how correlated the series is with\n",
        "itself at each lag; the partial autocorrelation function (PACF) measures the\n",
        "same after removing the effect of the shorter lags in between. Reading both\n",
        "together is how you propose a starting model order, and the persistence of\n",
        "spikes at multiples of 7 is how you confirm weekly seasonality."
      ],
      "id": "NddRTnv0FGvP"
    },
