      "source": [
        "### Augmented Dickey-Fuller (ADF) test\n",
        "\n",
        "A formal stationarity test to check what the ACF's slow decay already\n",
        "suggested about the raw series, and confirm what differencing changes.\n",
        "\n",
        "The ADF null hypothesis is **\"the series has a unit root\"** (i.e. it is\n",
        "non-stationary), so:\n",
        "- **low p-value (< 0.05) → reject the null → the series is stationary**, and\n",
        "- **high p-value (≥ 0.05) → fail to reject → we cannot rule out\n",
        "  non-stationarity.**\n",
        "\n",
        "This is the direction people most often get backwards: here a low p-value is\n",
        "the *good* outcome if what you want is a stationary series to model."
      ],
      "id": "dSLxG_Z-FGvQ"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "BPHqAo2oFGvQ",
        "outputId": "9857378e-e129-4e5e-a5cc-debb8afae334"
