      "source": [
        "## Section 6 — Probabilistic Forecasting & Prediction Intervals\n",
        "\n",
        "Every forecast so far is a single number per day. A planner carrying\n",
        "inventory also needs to know *how wrong the forecast might be*. This section\n",
        "produces an **80% prediction interval** with `sktime`'s `predict_interval`\n",
        "(the same API Lab 5 used) on a held-out window of the last 60 days, and\n",
        "scores it with **both** `coverage()` and `interval_width()` — never coverage\n",
        "alone, because an interval that covers 100% by being absurdly wide is not\n",
        "useful."
      ],
      "id": "KZRQayMOFGvR"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
